/-!
# Pose root of `Prism.OctagonalPrism.polyhedron`

ν and one optimal pose of `Prism.OctagonalPrism.polyhedron` (`fixtures/nieuwland/prism/octagonal-prism`) as the one root of a system, downstream of the representatives' theorem `prismOctagonalPrism_nu_reps_list` (a closed form). The weak fit at `ν` is the exact record's over the lift `ℤ[α]` (`rupert-lean-export lift-weak`), checked by the kernel (`weak_check`); the lift's points are the solid's `Dim` points (`points_eq`). The system `S` is `cfSystem` (`Modules/Pose/PoseCheck.lean`): `x 0 = ℓ`, `x 1 = α`, the pose's chart coordinates `x 2, …, x 9`, three helpers, `R₂ = matAt x 13`, `R₁ = matAt x 22`, `t = (x 31, x 32)`. Generated by `lean/scripts/poseroot.py`.
-/

namespace Nieuwland.Pose.PrismOctagonalPrism

open Check PolynomialSystem

